:"text","value":" 。同频率的紫外光照射基态氢原子时，恰能使其跃迁至 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{2}=\\frac{E_{1}}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的激发态，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为基态能量。已知普朗克常量为 h，真空中的光速为 c，下列说法正确的是\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 增加紫外光的频率，光电子的最大初动能增加"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 增加紫外光的频率，氢原子一定能跃迁至更高的能级"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若要使基态氢原子电离，紫外光的频率至少为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4}{3}\\nu"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 具有最大初动能的光电子，其德布罗意波长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{hc}{E_{k}}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--hangzhou-yimo-2611-q13","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--hangzhou-yimo-2611","source_question_id":"hangzhou-yimo-2611-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"239341202b0a90a729e3bccfb6a1a6cc43b58a9b4e695fb2c0200e17c9d0b9d2","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示，在水平面上，电子绕 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的原子核沿逆时针（俯视）做匀速圆周运动，半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" ，角速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega_0"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电子在轨道上的运动等效为一个环形电流，可产生一个固有磁场。在电子轨道平面内突然外加竖直向上、磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场后，电子的轨道半径保持不变，电子运动的角速度变化，变化量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta \\omega"},{"type":"text","value":" （ "},{"type":"math","value":"|\\Delta \\omega| \\ll \\omega_0"},{"type":"text","value":" ，可作相关近似计算），从而改变\n等效环形电流大小，阻碍磁场变化，这是物质抗磁性的一种经典解释。已知原子核的原子序数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"Z"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电子的电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":" ，质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，静电力常量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9e3e24c5356785450cb1159f8e8cbdc83d8cabeb254f0d1267feb0bca25ca851.png","width":305,"height":175,"width_mm":35.683,"row_group":"hangzhou-yimo-2611-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第13题图\n"}],"ch