0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 高速飞出，电子穿过特殊磁场区的过程中，沿z轴方向的速度可视为不变，而x方向获\n得速度，大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x} = \\frac{eB_{0}\\lambda}{2\\pi m} \\ll v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，此后从 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点飞入波荡器。电子在波荡器中做正弦式的扭摆运动，并辐射电磁波，电磁波的频率与电子扭摆的频率相同。已知电子电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":" ，质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电子在波荡器中做扭摆运动时，可视为沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"z"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴方向做匀速运动，沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴方向做简谐运动。忽略相对论效应与多普勒效应，求：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7a78985d5edf58c649cc0c4fbe17c6a4ec2b987483329bbf5e2e7395b09f212b.png","width":679,"height":334,"width_mm":79.75,"row_group":"hangzhou-yimo-2611-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图\n(1) 加速器两极板间的电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）在特殊磁场区，电子受到洛伦兹力冲量的大小和方向；\n（3）从某电子自 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点进入波荡器开始计时，\n① 电子受沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴方向的洛伦兹力随时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" 变化的规律；\n② 电子在波荡器中运动时沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴方向振动的振幅。\n（4）电子在波荡器中做周期性扭摆运动时，\n①辐射电磁波的频率；\n② 调整参数使辐射波长减半的情况下，调整后的加速电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的比值。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"eU_0 = \\frac{1}{2} mv_0^2 - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 2\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"U_0 = \\frac{mv_0^2}{2e}"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1\n(2)在"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴方向动量定理知"},{"type":"math","value":"I = mv_x - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{eB_0 \\lambda}{2\\pi}"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向沿"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴负方向…… 2\n(3)①沿"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴方向的洛伦兹力为"},{"type":"math","value":"F(t) = ev_0 B(z)"},{"type":"text","value":"，其中"},{"type":"math","value":"z = v_0 t"},{"type":"text","value":"，…… 1\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"F(t) = ev_0 B_0 \\sin \\left( \\frac{2\\pi}{\\lambda} v_0 t \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1\n②电子在"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"方向上做简谐振动，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"ev_0 B_0 = kA"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} mv_x^2 = \\frac{0 + kA}{2} A"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1\n联立解得振幅"},{"type":"math","value":"A = \\frac{eB_0 \\lambda^2}{4\\pi^2 mv_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1\n(4)①由（3）知圆频率"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega = \\frac{2\\pi}{\\lambda} v_0"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以电子辐射的电磁波的频率为"},{"type":"math","value":"f = \\frac{\\omega}{2\\pi} = \\frac{v_0}{\\lambda}"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1\n②电子辐射的波长"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_r = \\frac{c}{f} = \\frac{c\\lambda}{v_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以使"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_r"},{"type":"text","value":"减半需"},{"type":"math","value":"v_0"},{"type":"text","value":"加倍，由（1）可知加速电压应变为"},{"type":"math","value":"4U_0"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U}{U_0} = 4"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1"}]}}]}
